nodecode-run-debugger is a rewrite of Sahil-SS9's Sahil-SS9/agent-run-debugger:

  https://github.com/Sahil-SS9/agent-run-debugger
  commit f4eefefb47372afedee56618c89c6fbc5024ca2a
  Apache-2.0 (LICENSE); its copyright line is the stock placeholder
  "Copyright [yyyy] [name of copyright owner]", and the repository's NOTICE
  names the holder only by name, so the holder is taken as the author's
  GitHub handle, Sahil-SS9.

The original is a Python plugin for another harness: a strict Trace v1 contract, a
bounded JSONL reader with guards against archives and raw databases, a redaction
pass, an SQLite store with a retention window, a topological timeline, a
diagnosis of twelve rules, an inert replay, markdown/JSON/HTML reports and an
operator CLI, plus importers for two foreign transcript shapes. What was
rewritten here is the same lane in Common Lisp and nothing else: the guarded
reader, the strict reading of the event vocabulary, the digest of the bytes read,
the store (one JSON file a run under the home, pruned by the section's retention),
the partial-order timeline with its gaps and its concurrent pairs, the ranked
hypotheses with their alternatives and falsifiers, the reported cost, and the
inert replay. The five tools keep the original's names, and /rundebug covers the
subcommands the original's CLI took, with the report kept to the operator's own
command and written under the home.

What was left out, and why: the two foreign-transcript importers (a Claude Code
JSONL session and a session export of the other harness) are not ported, so this
cell reads the debugger's own trace format only; the SQLite store became one JSON
file a run (the same retention, no database to keep in step); the HTML and JSON
report formats are gone in favour of the one markdown report; the reserved lanes
the original declares and refuses (capture, live session read, model narration,
sandboxed experiments) stay unimplemented here, and `rundebug_status` says so; the
`import_max_depth` nesting bound and the envelope's `covered_kinds`,
`unsupported_kinds` and `private_digests` members are not carried, since this
reader bounds bytes, lines and records instead; unknown fields in a record are
ignored rather than refused, because the format is this cell's own and the source
is a person's file rather than another program's contract; and the operator CLI
with its subcommand parser is a slash command and five tools instead.
